
5 SPD 50 'set speed to 50%
10 MOV P21 'move (joint interpolation) to P21, the approach point above station 1
20 HOPEN 1 'open gripper to prepare for pick-up
30 DLY 1 'delay 1s for the gripper to finish opening
40 MVS P11 'move straight down to P11, the workpiece pick position at station 1
50 HCLOSE 1 'close gripper to grasp the workpiece at P11
60 DLY 1 'delay 1s for the gripper to finish closing
70 MVS P21 'move straight back up to P21, lifting the workpiece clear of station 1

90 MOV P22 'move (joint interpolation) to P22, the approach point above station 2, still holding the workpiece
100 DLY 1 'delay 1s
110 MVS P12 'move straight down to P12, placing the workpiece at station 2
120 HOPEN 1 'open gripper to release the workpiece at P12
130 DLY 1 'delay 1s for the gripper to finish opening
140 MVS P22 'move straight back up to P22, clear of the workpiece
150 DLY 1 'delay 1s
160 MVS P12 'move straight back down to P12 to re-grasp the same workpiece
170 HCLOSE 1 'close gripper to re-grasp the workpiece at P12
180 DLY 1 'delay 1s for the gripper to finish closing
190 MVS P22 'move straight back up to P22, lifting the workpiece clear

200 MOV P24 'move to P24, the approach point above station 3, still holding the workpiece
210 DLY 1 'delay 1s
220 MVS P14 'move straight down to P14, placing the workpiece at station 3
230 HOPEN 1 'open gripper to release the workpiece at P14
240 DLY 1 'delay 1s
250 MVS P24 'move straight back up to P24, clear of the workpiece
260 DLY 1 'delay 1s
270 MVS P14 'move straight back down to P14 to re-grasp the same workpiece
280 HCLOSE 1 'close gripper to re-grasp the workpiece at P14
290 DLY 1 'delay 1s
300 MVS P24 'move straight back up to P24, lifting the workpiece clear

310 MOV P26 'move to P26, the approach point above station 4, still holding the workpiece
320 DLY 1 'delay 1s
330 MVS P16 'move straight down to P16, placing the workpiece at its final station
340 HOPEN 1 'open gripper to release the workpiece at P16
350 DLY 1 'delay 1s
360 MVS P26 'move straight back up to P26, clear of the workpiece
370 DLY 1 'delay 1s
380 MVS P16 'move straight back down to P16 to re-grasp the same workpiece
390 HCLOSE 1 'close gripper to re-grasp the workpiece at P16
400 DLY 1 'delay 1s
410 MVS P26 'move straight back up to P26, holding the workpiece clear of station 4

420 WAIT M_IN(5) = 1 'wait until external input signal 5 goes high before finishing
430 END 'end of program
